AB  - Lis Riveros lsmr2 Thu, 20/08/2026 - 08:23 My doctoral research, supervised by Professor Helen McCarthy, examines the cultural, political, and business history of the English brewing industry since 1939. It explores the broader role of commercial actors in shaping social and cultural life, with particular attention to the relationship between business and the state. Methodologically, I am committed to bringing corporate and trade-body archives into dialogue with cultural and social history, alongside close attention to material culture (architecture, interior design, and advertising) as…
